        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "Reports drinking 3–4 premix cans most nights, up to approximately 8 on weekends, and no morning drinking. Partner is concerned. Patient minimizes use and says it helps her sleep. No withdrawal history reported."
      }
    },
