        "code": {
          "text": "Mental state examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "Alert, guarded, and engages with encouragement; occasionally tearful about nightmares. Appropriate appearance and good hygiene. Tense and fidgety, scanning the room and reluctant to elaborate unless prompted. Speech normal in rate and volume, becoming louder when describing conflict. Affect irritable and mildly anxious, congruent and reactive; verbally minimizes despite appearing more distressed. Thought form linear and goal-directed. No delusions or hallucinations. Insight partial; judgement intact regarding safety."
      }
